     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ServiceRequest example-drp-nursing-de-within-care-trajectory</b></p><a name=\"example-drp-nursing-de-within-care-trajectory\"> </a><a name=\"hcexample-drp-nursing-de-within-care-trajectory\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profile: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-ereferral-servicerequest-nursing.html\">EReferralServiceRequestNursing</a></p></div><p><b>BeValidityPeriod</b>: 2026-02-18 --&gt; 2026-12-31</p><p><b>BeFeedbackToPrescriber</b>: false</p><p><b>BePerformerType</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{http://snomed.info/sct 106292003}\">Professional nurse</span></p><p><b>BePerformerType</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{http://snomed.info/sct 224543004}\">Diabetic nurse</span></p><p><b>status</b>: Draft</p><p><b>intent</b>: Order</p><p><b>category</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{http://snomed.info/sct 9632001}\">Nursing procedure</span>, <span title=\"Codes:{https://www.ehealth.fgov.be/standards/fhir/terminology/CodeSystem/be-cs-prescription-type diabetic-education-within-care-trajectory}\">Diabetes education within a care trajectory</span></p><p><b>priority</b>: Routine</p><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{http://snomed.info/sct 385805005}\">urn:be:fgov:pseudo-encrypted:v1:{{kid}}:{{jwe}}</span></p><p><b>orderDetail</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{http://snomed.info/sct 370858005}\">Following clinical pathway protocol</span>, <span title=\"Codes:{https://www.ehealth.fgov.be/standards/fhir/terminology/CodeSystem/be-cs-diabetic-education-type diabetic-education-additional-hba1c}\">Additional education HBA1C&gt;7.5</span>, <span title=\"Codes:{https://www.ehealth.fgov.be/standards/fhir/terminology/CodeSystem/be-cs-session-types group-session}\">Group session</span></p><p><b>subject</b>: